# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true. Without this, a Windows checkout
# gets CRLF in the scripts and sources, which breaks shell scripts outright and makes
# every rendered SVG look modified on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.dot  text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
